<title>UK: UK meals and feed started week lower to unchanged.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feed started week lower to unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK meals and feeds prices were lower where changed on Monday but buyers failed to take advantage.</p>
<p>&quot;It's been a poor start to the week and frankly I can't see it getting any better,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>High protein soymeal sellers were one to two stg down for old crop while new crop was one stg higher.</p>
<p>Rapemeal ex-mill was one stg down while the remainder of the market was unchanged.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
